{
  "name": "tolca-safe-pay",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Drop-in safety check for x402 agent payments: before paying a new seller, ask Tolca payment-check (OFAC SDN wallet screen, official USDC, Coinbase Bazaar price and wallet match) and refuse block, stop on review.",
